 {(nav==='resources'||nav==='search'&&searchFrom==='resources')&&<section hidden={nav!=='resources'} className={'workspace-resource-stage'+(resourceFocus?' resource-detail-active':'')}><div className="workspace-resource-prelude"><button className="vocabulary-entry panel workspace-exam-entry" onClick={()=>setMockOpen(true)}><Clock size={29} className="vocabulary-entry-icon"/><span><b>完整听读模考</b><small>导入个人题包 · 200 题计时 · 成绩与复盘</small></span><ArrowUpRight size={20}/></button><VocabularyEntry onOpen={()=>{setNav('vocabulary');window.scrollTo({top:0});}}/><div className="section-intro"><p>把材料、练习和收获留在一起。</p><span className="pill">官方入口 + 原创内容</span></div><ExamCollection checkins={data.checkins} onRecord={r=>{setMinutes(String(r.minutes));setSelectedResource({id:r.id,title:r.title});setNote('');setLoad('刚好');setCheckinError('');setCheckinOpen(true);}}/><section className="resource-collection"><div className="resource-cover"><Library size={38}/><span>VOL. 02</span><h2>微光<br/>原创练习集</h2><small>LISTEN · READ · SPEAK</small></div><div><p className="eyebrow">THE OPEN COLLECTION</p><h2>从第一道题，积累自己的学习资源。</h2><p>{questions.length} 道听读练习、{prompts.length} 类口语任务，附答案依据、中文解析与表达示例。题目为原创练习，听力使用系统朗读。</p><div className="button-row"><button className="button primary" onClick={()=>setNav('train')}>打开练习<ArrowRight size={16}/></button><button className="button secondary" onClick={()=>saveFile('lantern-original-starter.json',JSON.stringify({version:'0.2.0',license:'CC-BY-4.0',attribution:'LANTERN 微光托业原创起步包',questions,prompts},null,2))}><Download size={16}/>下载原创题包</button></div><small>原创文本按 CC BY 4.0 分享；官方链接及主题素材单独标注。</small></div></section></div><ResourceLibrary onDetailChange={setResourceFocus} checkins={data.checkins} checkinOpen={nav!=='resources'||checkinOpen||settings||themeOpen||installOpen||!!recordingPlay} recordsReady={ready&&!readBlocked} onRecord={r=>{setMinutes(String(r.minutes));setSelectedResource({id:r.id,title:r.title});setNote('');setLoad('刚好');setCheckinError('');setCheckinOpen(true);}}/><section className="panel resource-note"><h3>共享内容，保留各自的学习记录</h3><p>原创题包可以导出分享。你的作答、录音和手记单独保存，不包含在公共题包中。词库记录请在词库内单独导出。官方题目与音频通过原网站访问。</p><button className="text-button" onClick={downloadStudyBackup}>导出听读与口语记录<Download size={15}/></button></section></section>}
